# Legacy Backend Plan

The authoritative cross-project SpecKit plan is now [specs/001-pos-saas-platform/plan.md](specs/001-pos-saas-platform/plan.md). This file is retained as a backend stage summary for compatibility.

## Stage 0
Bootstrap Go, configuration, database, Redis, HTTP server, migrations, health, CI.

## Stage 1
Implement tenant/user/device/session schema, RLS, indexes, and integration tests.

## Stage 2
Implement authentication, JWT validation, refresh rotation, session lifecycle, rate limiting.

## Stage 3
Implement categories/products/barcode lookup.

## Stage 4
Implement sales, exact money calculations, stock transaction rules, idempotency.

## Stage 5
Implement offline synchronization using monotonic server sequence and command IDs.

## Stage 6
Implement metrics, hardening, benchmarks, security scanning, backup verification.

## Stage 7
Production packaging, Caddy/TLS, systemd/container deployment, monitoring, rollback.

## Rule
Implement one stage at a time. Do not implement the entire backend in a single generated change.
